{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel back to the Warring States period and experience the thrill of chariots charging across the battlefield!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game blends rich historical settings with intense, action-packed gameplay, immersing you in the epic clash between infantry and war chariots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the child of a renowned Warring States general, you will choose to side with either Prince Li or Prince Jia, fighting alongside them and uncovering a complex and gripping storyline. Face a variety of infantry formations, from sword-wielding soldiers and skilled archers to the unyielding spear phalanx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With diverse formations, deep tactical gameplay, and dynamic battlefield changes, every battle is an unpredictable challenge filled with strategy and excitement!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2628470?t=1744545067","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2628470?t=1744545067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628470/dea67582844f5fb5cf6559c260daf844ad0c9a5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744545067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2628470/dea67582844f5fb5cf6559c260daf844ad0c9a5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744545067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Travel back to the Warring States period and experience the thrill of chariots charging across the battlefield!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game blends rich historical settings with intense, action-packed gameplay, immersing you in the epic clash between infantry and war chariots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the child of a renowned Warring States genera